Freedom and Democracy
Scope & Core Inquiries: Does this company actively defend and uphold the principles of freedom, liberal democracy, and civil liberties, or does it enable authoritarianism and democratic backsliding? Do this company's executives, board members, or major owners support right-wing or anti-democratic politicians financially, verbally, or through corporate policy? Does the company tolerate, amplify, or monetize extremist right-wing political speech, disinformation, election denialism, or violent rhetoric on its platforms or within its workplaces? Is the internal company culture tightly and autocratically controlled by wealthy executives who suppress political dissent, punish civic participation, or retaliate against worker speech? Does the company collaborate with or profit from authoritarian regimes—such as by complying with state censorship, providing surveillance tools to repressive governments, or aiding in the targeting of journalists, protestors, and political dissidents? Does this company believe in and demonstrably protect democratic institutions, the rule of law, and universal human rights?